      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIGHLY CONNECTED (2) is racing well without winning, recording four minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when second (29.98) over 525m at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Overdue and is among the main hopes. POINT BREAK (8) missed the frame latest (34.97) when eighth over 595m at Sandown in a Grade 4/5. Boasts a top strike-rate from this draw, winning three of five runs. Looks one of the chances. ZIPPING KIMELI (3) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fifth (31.11) at Gawler last time. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Yet to miss the placings from three starts out of this box. Worth following up. MILLY LILY (4) was a shock winner last start and is in the mix again.",
